  "title": "Easy Butternut Squash Ravioli",
  "description": "Butternut squash ravioli filled with roasted butternut squash, mascarpone, and sage. This easy recipe from Chef John uses wonton wrappers instead of pasta.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2011-10-12T18:42:36-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-22T17:22:47-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT10M",
  "total_time": "PT40M",
  "yield": [
    "6"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Appetizer"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Italian Inspired",
    "Italian"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Italian Inspired",
    "Italian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup mashed, cooked butternut squash",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper",
    "0.5 cup mascarpone cheese",
    "1 egg yolk",
    "0.33333334326744 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "1 (16 ounce) package round wonton wrappers",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "1 clove garlic, unpeeled",
    "chopped fresh sage to taste",
    "1 tablespoon grated Parmesan cheese, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6twTB6532tiYy3xR_HLZxmwCCWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-01-2ae66315dda64886b4a83304fed860de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place mashed squash into a mixing bowl. Add salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper. Stir in mascarpone cheese, egg yolk, and 1/3 cup Parmesan cheese, mixing until filling is combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x7rMCu7dIlAHQNKaWkO87MAIAg0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-02-a13b24b67f3a402cad6ce4a6c5cfd8f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a wonton wrapper onto a working surface. Wet the tip of a finger in water, and run it all along the outer edge of the wonton skin to moisten. Place about 1 teaspoon of filling in the center of the wonton.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Nphf0FlJdNkV2Dltia3ckwEX58g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-03-504fc7d12626428f9686c99c93472f63.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the wonton in half to make a half-moon shape, and press the edges to seal. Repeat with the remaining wonton wrappers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DL6fuxomj4OxB3pejgnIBLzXacs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-04-c4177fb4402841a881b24424299a4456.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a deep skillet over medium-low heat. Stir in butter and unpeeled clove of garlic.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LlNOJEJm_xrfTrtWzaZen8iKzJA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-05-58b452f15a794ca5a48e4b9d1b72644e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, bring a saucepan of lightly salted water to a boil. Drop filled ravioli into boiling water, a few at a time, and cook until they float to the top, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p7nkbxZdnmnSmhR4bCtj2qOKtys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-06-a0b496691c914fcab40e30af155cde4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain ravioli, and transfer to the skillet. Increase heat to medium-high, and cook just until ravioli are infused with garlic butter flavor, about 2 or 3 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CsnDyqAP6a_tKghF8PqJy2ViRvg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-step-07-b12526bcfd214b1fa50e7cd712b94926.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot; sprinkle with chopped sage, more black pepper, and extra Parmesan cheese to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nPYxKQ1z4r11NDW8EEiaq8KXcx8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219174-easy-butternut-squash-ravioli-VAT-Beauty-4x3-6dd4c81a3a774c7e9f60ab2ba4a2287c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219174/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
